[{"client_msg_id":"36be0759-7e82-4c2a-95e3-3bd6e32cb940","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"大事","ts":"1627958347.074100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4cab5fc-2031-4a68-8a92-62f9c117f33f","type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"敵の人的削ってるあたりはHOIと変わらないのかも","ts":"1627954400.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1971d50b-613d-4c14-9e0d-ac244e1b58cc","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"敵にうまく戦力を逐次的に投入してもらって消耗させ、枯渇したところでたぶん向こうが諦めて和平しようとするので、そこから一気に攻め込むと簡単に都市奪えたりします。そこから忠誠度的な意味で防衛するの大変なのでちゃんと滅亡させないといけなくてちょっと大変だけど","ts":"1627952864.072200","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1627952879.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"innocent","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08d76322-6a60-46d6-a875-b3084d44a94d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみに宣戦されるのはむしろ敵の戦力が増大しつづけるのを防ぐ的な意味で実際に攻めになっています。防衛の方が圧倒的に兵站がラクで生存率が高い","ts":"1627952781.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1K0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f9edc72-3ab7-4d2f-9e66-b67390f9f086","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"攻めの守り","ts":"1627952751.069900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ec61a1c-2c6c-431f-951f-34713aa5c6db","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"防壁大事","ts":"1627952743.069400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EyC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73ff5c7c-1279-44f6-9f3a-0ed264dd6aaf","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"高難易度だと弓術→石工術からの防壁最優先という学びがあった","ts":"1627949862.069000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mKk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb16a0af-d1bc-4a2b-bb8a-29ca0f79c8ea","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"先ほどちょっと戦争プレイ試したら、都市少ないとローマがキレる→宣戦布告といういつもの流れをくらいました。","ts":"1627949664.068400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=fm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdad6506-d577-48ca-9e3b-802d450c8c04","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"僕は王子プレイとかで遊んだあと試しにいきなり不死に挑戦してみたのが初期にあって、そのときは太古のうちから愕然として膝から崩れ落ちました。あの感覚はすごかった","ts":"1627948985.067200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dJj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93f646ba-6e99-403e-9f3c-6dfbce1bf67b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(といいつつまあそれでも負けるときは負けるかな、立地によっては蛮族と隣国同時本気ラッシュされてなすすべもなくやられるままのことはあるし・・・!)","ts":"1627948912.065700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FHp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d1eba1-9d76-44b3-8b03-a1b806495ef5","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(ちなみに皇帝もたぶんまだチュートリアルです! ゲームシステムわかると無双しほうだいになる)","ts":"1627948696.064300","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1627948731.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0uK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6025ae8a-2d3c-42f4-a6a1-1af2ef2eb23e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです、あの感覚最高です","ts":"1627948686.063900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a9ipg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b18f15d-94d5-4e48-8118-2144415708c4","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"国王まではチュートリアルだったのだなぁと。\nCiv4高難易度やっていたころの、ターン送りするたびに胃がｷｭｯなってなる感じがでてきて楽しくなってきた。","ts":"1627943578.063200","edited":{"user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1627943612.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8hP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6417314-adee-4386-92e3-16ccc9a92adc","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"難易度皇帝ぐらいから真のcivの姿がちらりと見えはじめる","ts":"1627920012.062100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U9E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da26ccf7-cab4-43a0-bcbc-65f4a15afcdd","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"めっちゃあるある","ts":"1627919989.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nzc"}]}]
